# seed/host/fstatfs/fstatfs.cases: fstatfs (keyword 215), run by the OM-2 conductor
# (seed/qualification/om2/gate.om) from seed/host/fstatfs/check.sh (OMC, its sha256, this file, SCRATCH).
# fixture: seed/host/fstatfs/fstatfs.om parent mode, 12 checks (exit 0 = all hold; see its notes).
# Refusals: a text or a view is not writable (error 20); a ulong array or a ulong descriptor is error 7; no
# x86linux / x86efi / a64efi lowering (25); program mode only, so both an OM-1 and an OM-2 function unit refuse
# it (9; unlike fstat, which OM-2 function units may use); no host word in a contract clause (30).
# Mutants of seed/omc/omc.om: min119 (capacity 119 admitted: killed at check 6, the closed descriptor then
# reaches the kernel) and sysno (statfs 43 instead of fstatfs 44: killed at check 1).
deadline 60
fixture run seed/host/fstatfs/fstatfs.om - - - 0
text refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/text.om 20
view refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/view.om 20
ulong-array refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/ulongarr.om 7
ulong-fd refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/fdtype.om 7
x86linux refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/x86linux.om 25
x86efi refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/x86efi.om 25
a64efi refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/a64efi.om 25
om1-function refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/om1fn.om 9
om2-function refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/om2fn.om 9
contract refuse seed/host/fstatfs/refusals/contract.om 30
subst seed/host/fstatfs/mutants/min119.from seed/host/fstatfs/mutants/min119.to
cc seed/omc/omc.om
mut-min119 run seed/host/fstatfs/fstatfs.om - - - 6
cc pinned
subst seed/host/fstatfs/mutants/sysno.from seed/host/fstatfs/mutants/sysno.to
cc seed/omc/omc.om
mut-sysno run seed/host/fstatfs/fstatfs.om - - - 1
cc pinned
